    "body": "D1 - moveBefore is out of scope.\r\n\r\nD2 - I've revised the wording per your feedback. The ordering of custom element reactions is out of scope for this PR. Browsers all already disagree on the ordering and it will be addressed by a follow-up that handles the ordering for all relevant APIs not just this specific case.\r\n\r\nD3 - I've added an updated test for the image input case. moveBefore is out of scope.",
