    "body": "For the record the test case `<form id=\"f\"></form><order-face id=\"first\" form=\"f\"></order-face><order-face id=\"second\" form=\"f\"></order-face>` isn't actually consistently ordered in chrome, it changes on each page load, same for Firefox and Servo. Interestingly WebKit seems to guarantee the ordering in this case to be first then second.",
